{"id":"vod_sn_38645","vodId":"38645","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"速写者","name_cn":"速写者","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/b9497751f444a077897d8056977d6dc3.jpg"},"summary":"这是一个黑白颠倒欲望横行的罪恶时代，贫富差距的急剧增大直接导致了罪恶和仇恨的火种开始暗自燃烧。在六木本俱乐部中有着一个关于“女神”的传说，传说中，只要得到了女神的祝福，便能够实现所想的愿望。前战地摄影师雑贺辰己（高田裕司 配音）正在调查一宗议员谋杀案，误打误撞之中，他得到了女神——少女天王洲神乐（斉藤圭 配音）的吻，当他因拍下了女神容貌而被追杀的时候，辰己发现自己奇迹般的拥有了不死之身，而手中的相机，似乎也有了如同武器一般的强大威力。　　长久以来，神乐都遭受着母亲天王洲神泉（高岛雅罗 配音）的虐待，成为女神，更是由于被催眠之故。于是，辰己带着神乐，利用自己“写杀”的异能力，开始了一段惊险而又刺激的逃亡之旅。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:03:20","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/in5ztpJsQK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6gmQKYS7gC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pvshAUW8Gp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/STdg193rtN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WeHeakCPpA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uDxfFpb1P91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TcEAxdMa3S1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dJREk9zfAY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KaYM2DK8LP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/N64NijNmzN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kLgfY5U6591/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q05HD9tQVt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Er7xG6qh9f1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1uzaisa2ag1/video/index.m3u8